{"problem_id": "3cc3cd1a-8a85-42ca-a56f-523eaf0c2476", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 14, "items": [{"at": "2026-10-05T23:37:57.555746+00:00", "by": {"type": "mcp"}, "value": {"alt": "График гиперболы", "url": "/assets/9d21dc00-d1fc-42d3-9a61-e134f0fd1e03", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"49ca2ae0-4c79-4ede-a563-9a7d8c03f7c5\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/49ca2ae0-4c79-4ede-a563-9a7d8c03f7c5\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "9d21dc00-d1fc-42d3-9a61-e134f0fd1e03", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "replace", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-05T22:45:11.296567+00:00", "by": {"type": "mcp"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"49ca2ae0-4c79-4ede-a563-9a7d8c03f7c5\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/49ca2ae0-4c79-4ede-a563-9a7d8c03f7c5\"/>На рисунке изображён график функции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x+a}\"></span> .  Найдите значение <i>x</i>, при котором <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=-0{,}125\"></span>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-05T23:37:57.858122+00:00", "by": {"type": "mcp"}, "value": {"html": "<section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Решение\"><center><img alt=\"Две красные точки для подстановки в формулу гиперболы\" data-asset-id=\"6b26af22-1883-4269-8fc9-90a03a9d5e57\" data-asset-key=\"shared_6b26af2218834269\" src=\"/assets/6b26af22-1883-4269-8fc9-90a03a9d5e57\"/></center><p>Возьмём две точки: <span data-inline-latex=\"A(3;-1)\"></span> и <span data-inline-latex=\"B(-1;-5)\"></span>. Подставим их координаты в формулу <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\frac{k}{x+a}\"></span>.</p><center><p><span data-formula-render-mode=\"display\" data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}-1=\\frac{k}{3+a}\\\\-5=\\frac{k}{-1+a}\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}k=-3-a\\\\k=5-5a\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}4a=8\\\\k=-3-a\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}a=2\\\\k=-5\\end{cases}\"></span></p></center><center><p><span data-formula-render-mode=\"display\" data-inline-latex=\"\\Rightarrow f(x)=\\frac{-5}{x+2}\"></span></p></center><center><p><span data-formula-render-mode=\"display\" data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{-5}{x+2}=-\\frac{1}{8}\\iff x+2=\\frac{-5}{-\\frac{1}{8}}=40\\iff x=38\"></span></p></center></section><section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Альтернативное решение\"><center><img alt=\"Красный горизонтальный отрезок и отступ от асимптоты для вычисления k\" data-asset-id=\"584bf753-8428-4a99-a8b6-cd238a9cb6f4\" data-asset-key=\"shared_584bf75384284a99\" src=\"/assets/584bf753-8428-4a99-a8b6-cd238a9cb6f4\"/></center><p>Так как график сдвинут на <span data-inline-latex=\"2\"></span> влево, <span data-inline-latex=\"a=+2\"></span>.</p><p>Ветви графика расположены в второй и четвёртой четвертях относительно асимптот, поэтому <span data-inline-latex=\"k&lt;0\"></span>.</p><p>Возьмём точку на <span data-inline-latex=\"1\"></span> ниже горизонтальной асимптоты. Красный горизонтальный отрезок показывает отступ от вертикальной асимптоты: <span data-inline-latex=\"5\"></span> вправо. <span data-inline-latex=\"\\Rightarrow k=-5\"></span>.</p><center><p><span data-formula-render-mode=\"display\" data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{-5}{x+2}\"></span></p></center><center><p><span data-formula-render-mode=\"display\" data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{-5}{x+2}=-\\frac{1}{8}\\iff x+2=\\frac{-5}{-\\frac{1}{8}}=40\\iff x=38\"></span></p></center></section>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_1", "shared_6b26af2218834269", "shared_584bf75384284a99"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:03.045418+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:03.045418+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:03.045418+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:03.045418+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:03.045418+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_5"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:03.045418+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_6"}, {"at": "2026-10-05T23:37:57.705777+00:00", "by": {"type": "mcp"}, "value": {"alt": "Две красные точки для подстановки в формулу гиперболы", "url": "/assets/6b26af22-1883-4269-8fc9-90a03a9d5e57", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "6b26af22-1883-4269-8fc9-90a03a9d5e57", "position": 1, "asset_key": "shared_6b26af2218834269", "parent_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, "operation": "add", "transformation_target_id": "asset:shared_6b26af2218834269"}, {"at": "2026-10-05T23:37:57.764656+00:00", "by": {"type": "mcp"}, "value": {"alt": "Красный горизонтальный отрезок и отступ от асимптоты для вычисления k", "url": "/assets/584bf753-8428-4a99-a8b6-cd238a9cb6f4", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "584bf753-8428-4a99-a8b6-cd238a9cb6f4", "position": 2, "asset_key": "shared_584bf75384284a99", "parent_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, "operation": "add", "transformation_target_id": "asset:shared_584bf75384284a99"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "График гиперболы", "url": "/assets/9d21dc00-d1fc-42d3-9a61-e134f0fd1e03", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "9d21